MFLOW 2
NAME Pneumatic conveyor
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 A strong blower picks sand and some fluff up\nfrom the feeder, through an expansion and up\nthe tall riser.\nThe 3-way valve at the top splits the flow\ninto two long lines with drop outlets.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Select the 3-way valve and press R to send all\nthe sand one way.\nTurn the blower down until the sand falls back.\nAdd water to the feeder and compare.

